{'symbol': 'COST', 'date': '2022-07-07 16:15:00', 'title': 'COSTCO WHOLESALE CORPORATION REPORTS JUNE SALES RESULTS', 'text': 'ISSAQUAH, WASH., JULY 07, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- COSTCO WHOLESALE CORPORATION (“COSTCO” OR THE “COMPANY”) (NASDAQ: COST) TODAY REPORTED NET SALES OF $22.78 BILLION FOR THE RETAIL MONTH OF JUNE, THE FIVE WEEKS ENDED JULY 3, 2022, AN INCREASE OF 20.4 PERCENT FROM $18.92 BILLION LAST YEAR.'}